{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50835","headline":"僊僧洞 · 缪岛云","name":"僊僧洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先朝曾有日东僧，向此乘龙忽上昇。\n石径已迷红树密，萝龛犹在紫云凝。\n鉢盂峯下留丹竃，锡杖前边隐圣灯。\n从此旧庵遗迹畔，月楼霜殿一层层。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缪岛云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50835.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50835","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}